<title>HONG KONG: C.Lyonnais revises Lai Sun Dev warrants.</title>
<headline>C.Lyonnais revises Lai Sun Dev warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd adjusted the expected payment and listing dates on its further 165 million American-style call warrants on shares of Lai Sun Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Other terms remain unchanged.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$11.25	 PREMIUM	  13.82 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.275	 GEARING	  4.47X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.NOV.97	PAYDATE	  3.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE   5.FEB.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT	10,000</p>
<p> NOTE: CASH SETTLEMENT OF EXERCISE AMOUNT PAYABLE IN HK$ OR</p>
<p>	 PHYSICAL DELIVERY OF STOCKS AT THE DISCRETION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
